    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      379.45,
      540.01,
      442.48
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 9 of the Civil Aviation Authority of Sri Lanka Act, No. 34 of 2002, andin pursuance of the Cabinet decision taken on 14th June 2016 on the Cabinet Memorandum No. 16/1031/709/035-1 dated31st May 2016, on \u201cOperation and Maintenance of Batticaloa Airport\u201d submitted by me, I, Nimal Siripala De Silva, Ministerof Transport and Civil Aviation, do by this Order, transfer and vest in the Civil Aviation Authority of Sri Lanka the Batticaloaairport which it listed under Second Schedule Aerodromes to the aforementioned Act with immediate effect.",
